notes.content:
Hello dear few players,


I have listened to feedback from some players and made the following updates to the game:


[b]1，Removed the restrictive effects of 5 basic attributes on character mobility and modified them to a simpler and more intuitive mechanism for improvement. Players will no longer be trapped in ineffective actions due to insufficient basic attributes; [/b]


2. A small increase in the basic survival points obtained after completing battles each day;

3. Slightly reduced the cost of survival points required for fitness;

4. Modified some innate abilities to make the game more enjoyable;

5. Removed depth of field blurring that may cause blurred field of view;

6. Some optimizations have been made to the frame rate;
